  # PANCOR JACKHAMMER (owner, 2026-10-31): the prototype bullpup auto shotgun, NOT a melee tool. Its magazine is the
  # 10-round rotating "ammo cassette" (drum). In this mesh: surf 1 "cylinder" = the drum's visible face, still
  # (travel 0.01); the cassette itself is the mod's OWN second mesh jackhammer_mag.md3 (MODELDEF Model 1), copied here as
  # cola_piledriver_mag.md3. Its 20 frames ARE the reload: seated at frames 0..1 (x -20.9, z 1.5), drops straight
  # down -Z to z -37 by frame 5, swings forward/up (x +7.9) and back in by frame 11 (measured, mag centroid per frame).
  # Fires PiledriverClip (shells), reload state ReloadStart at PDRV B. Archetype shotgun_drum; mag = the cassette mesh.
  carved      mag  file cola_piledriver_mag.md3  (the mod's own mesh, not carved by us)  seat_origin [-20.9, 0.0, 1.5]
